 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In this town, stars fall from the sky every night.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Not shooting stars.",
   "tag": "[intrigued]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Real stars.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Tiny glowing ones that land in people's gardens.",
   "tag": "[warmly]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone collects them in glass jars.",
   "tag": "[warmly]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "And each star grants one wish.",
   "tag": "[intrigued]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "But there's one rule.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Never wish for another star.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "One night, a girl named Ruby found a golden star outside her window.",
   "tag": "[curious]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "It was brighter than anything she'd ever seen.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "She held it close and whispered,",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "“I wish I had a thousand more.”",
   "speak": "I wish I had a thousand more.",
   "voice": "ruby",
   "tag": "[whispers, excited]",
   "fx": "whisper",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly, the sky began shaking.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "One star fell.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Then ten.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Then hundreds.",
   "tag": "[excited]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Within seconds, thousands of glowing stars were raining down.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "The streets filled with golden light.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Ruby looked up in amazement.",
   "tag": "[amazed]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "But then she noticed something terrifying.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "The stars weren't falling.",
   "tag": "[fearful]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "They were escaping.",
   "tag": "[fearful]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "And behind them, the night sky was opening.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Something enormous was waking up.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.5
  },
  {
   "text": "And it was missing its eyes.",
   "tag": "[terrified, whispers]",
   "pause": 0.0
  }
